OL,3,GNEWSAScam sees 'bogus' callers pose as
OL,4,Apolice officers
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents are being urged to be
OL,7,Fvigilant for scammers after a police
OL,8,Fforce received reports of "bogus"
OL,9,Fcallers pretending to be its officers.
OL,11,FSuffolk Police said there had been
OL,12,F"multiple reports" on Wednesday and
OL,13,FThursday of scammers calling members of
OL,14,Fthe public and falsely claiming to be
OL,15,Fpolice officers.
OL,17,FAccording to the force, the fraudsters
OL,18,Fappeared to have phoned from a cloned
OL,19,Fnumber, meaning calls made back to it
OL,20,Fwould be routed to the Suffolk Police
OL,21,Fswitchboard.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,380,370,200,160,0,100
