OL,3,GNEWSAScam sees 'bogus' callers pose as
OL,4,Apolice officers
OL,5,
OL,6,FSuffolk Police and Suffolk Trading
OL,7,FStandards said anyone who receives a
OL,8,Fcall from someone claiming to be an
OL,9,Fofficer should call 101 to check their
OL,10,Fidentity.
